(7163101, 1099872, 114285, '<td valign="top">Amazing just love this one!</td>', 'Amazing just love this one!', '2014-01-27 00:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7163103, 1099540, 30982, '<td valign="top">Such beautiful form, and I love the light!  That wee glimmer in her eye is just perfect.</td>', 'Such beautiful form, and I love the light!  That wee glimmer in her eye is just perfect.', '2014-01-27 00:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7163104, 1100082, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the wee touches of warm color from the flags, particularly in the reflection.</td>', 'I like the wee touches of warm color from the flags, particularly in the reflection.', '2014-01-27 00:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7163106, 1099367, 30982, '<td valign="top">A lovely, quiet view.  Is there a slight chill in the air?</td>', 'A lovely, quiet view.  Is there a slight chill in the air?', '2014-01-27 00:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7163107, 1100150, 30982, '<td valign="top">Great sense of scale, particularly with the waves breaking out from shore.</td>', 'Great sense of scale, particularly with the waves breaking out from shore.', '2014-01-27 00:13:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7163112, 1099683, 124815, '<td valign="top"><strike></strike>86</td>', '86', '2014-01-27 00:17:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7163117, 1100070, 30982, '<td valign="top">What lovely finesse!</td>', 'What lovely finesse!', '2014-01-27 00:23:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7163119, 1099293, 30982, '<td valign="top">What a great expression!!</td>', 'What a great expression!!', '2014-01-27 00:24:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7163120, 1099190, 30982, '<td valign="top">How to capitalize on a marvelous sight!  Thanks for sharing.  I love the curls of the wingtips.</td>', 'How to capitalize on a marvelous sight!  Thanks for sharing.  I love the curls of the wingtips.', '2014-01-27 00:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7163124, 1100067, 30982, '<td valign="top">Almost surrealistically perfect, like a scene from a carefully crafted dream.</td>', 'Almost surrealistically perfect, like a scene from a carefully crafted dream.', '2014-01-27 00:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7163127, 1098886, 30982, '<td valign="top">Sweet!  The poor little thing looks less than thrilled with the moment, but I''m guessing the parents love this.  Very nice work with the light.</td>', 'Sweet!  The poor little thing looks less than thrilled with the moment, but I''m guessing the parents love this.  Very nice work with the light.', '2014-01-27 00:27:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7163129, 1100139, 30982, '<td valign="top">An interesting abstract to explore.  I like the way the shadows vary throughout.</td>', 'An interesting abstract to explore.  I like the way the shadows vary throughout.', '2014-01-27 00:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7163131, 1098862, 30982, '<td valign="top">The River Styx reference?  Nicely composed, masterfully edited, and a lovely added bonus with the moon!</td>', 'The River Styx reference?  Nicely composed, masterfully edited, and a lovely added bonus with the moon!', '2014-01-27 00:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7163133, 1099852, 27133, '<td valign="top">Hi Hanneke.  Great to see you again!  :))))</td>', 'Hi Hanneke.  Great to see you again!  :))))', '2014-01-27 00:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7163138, 1099444, 17203, '<td valign="top">Well that''s not even fair. Everybody else has to take their photos on earth with only the colors found in nature. Say hello to Dorothy and Toto and congrats on the ribbon.</td>', 'Well that''s not even fair. Everybody else has to take their photos on earth with only the colors found in nature. Say hello to Dorothy and Toto and congrats on the ribbon.', '2014-01-27 00:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7163141, 1099852, 30982, '<td valign="top">So nice to see you again, beautiful lady!  This is classic YOU!</td>', 'So nice to see you again, beautiful lady!  This is classic YOU!', '2014-01-27 00:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7163142, 1099039, 30982, '<td valign="top">Cool!  What a great study of light!</td>', 'Cool!  What a great study of light!', '2014-01-27 00:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7163143, 1099455, 30982, '<td valign="top">Wow.  What a stupendous sky!  Space station or airplane?</td>', 'Wow.  What a stupendous sky!  Space station or airplane?', '2014-01-27 00:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7163144, 1099924, 30982, '<td valign="top">Incredible detail - what a gorgeous bird!  Seems to be very interested in what you''re doing, too!</td>', 'Incredible detail - what a gorgeous bird!  Seems to be very interested in what you''re doing, too!', '2014-01-27 00:44:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7163146, 1099677, 30982, '<td valign="top">I love the bird - what a cute, pleasant surprise.  Wonderful rich color and well composed.  But mostly I love the bird!</td>', 'I love the bird - what a cute, pleasant surprise.  Wonderful rich color and well composed.  But mostly I love the bird!', '2014-01-27 00:45:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7163149, 1100024, 30982, '<td valign="top">Finely presented and a lovely study indeed.</td>', 'Finely presented and a lovely study indeed.', '2014-01-27 00:47:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7163151, 1099970, 30982, '<td valign="top">Incredible light - a beautiful presentation of this magnificent beast.  I''m pleased to see this in B&amp;W - emphasizes that gorgeous light.</td>', 'Incredible light - a beautiful presentation of this magnificent beast.  I''m pleased to see this in B&W - emphasizes that gorgeous light.', '2014-01-27 00:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7163152, 1100093, 30982, '<td valign="top">Fine use of light and filling the frame.  She needs a pearl earring.  :-)</td>', 'Fine use of light and filling the frame.  She needs a pearl earring.  :-)', '2014-01-27 00:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7163153, 1099598, 30861, '<td valign="top">Is this an actual Chestnut Bob? It''s an awesome canoe. We have an Adirondack Guide Boat, or rather a modern take on one made of Kevlar. Very cool canoe, very nice image.</td>', 'Is this an actual Chestnut Bob? It''s an awesome canoe. We have an Adirondack Guide Boat, or rather a modern take on one made of Kevlar. Very cool canoe, very nice image.', '2014-01-27 00:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7163154, 1099811, 30982, '<td valign="top">So I''m really hoping the border is legal (and it should be) because this is a pretty darn cool shot!  The way you have her posed and the angle of the shoot makes her look like a lovely ice cream cone girl!  Great eyes, love the freckles, and there''s just a nice sweetness (with a hint of spice from that red hair) to the portrait.  Nicely done!</td>', 'So I''m really hoping the border is legal (and it should be) because this is a pretty darn cool shot!  The way you have her posed and the angle of the shoot makes her look like a lovely ice cream cone girl!  Great eyes, love the freckles, and there''s just a nice sweetness (with a hint of spice from that red hair) to the portrait.  Nicely done!', '2014-01-27 00:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7163155, 1099564, 30982, '<td valign="top">Perfect timing, exquisite light.</td>', 'Perfect timing, exquisite light.', '2014-01-27 01:00:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7163157, 1100137, 30982, '<td valign="top">I don''t like your title, but I really like the picture.  There''s something about the building''s windows - watching the passage of time, perhaps - as the elderly neighbor steps by.  And that one poor little bush, planted in that small space, doing its best to add some life.  All in all, a sad story.</td>', 'I don''t like your title, but I really like the picture.  There''s something about the building''s windows - watching the passage of time, perhaps - as the elderly neighbor steps by.  And that one poor little bush, planted in that small space, doing its best to add some life.  All in all, a sad story.', '2014-01-27 01:02:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7163159, 1099714, 30982, '<td valign="top">Kincaid''ish light, with all that golden glow.  I like the conflict of the cold blues and the warm golds.</td>', 'Kincaid''ish light, with all that golden glow.  I like the conflict of the cold blues and the warm golds.', '2014-01-27 01:04:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7163160, 1100059, 30982, '<td valign="top">A really nice stolen moment - lovely subject, for one thing.  I like the elegance of the photo, and yes, I wonder what has taken her attention away from her phone - the focus of everyone''s attention these days.</td>', 'A really nice stolen moment - lovely subject, for one thing.  I like the elegance of the photo, and yes, I wonder what has taken her attention away from her phone - the focus of everyone''s attention these days.', '2014-01-27 01:06:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7163161, 1100033, 30982, '<td valign="top">What a great title.  It''s always the dogs and kids who catch the stealth photogs, you know.  A wonderful morning indeed.</td>', 'What a great title.  It''s always the dogs and kids who catch the stealth photogs, you know.  A wonderful morning indeed.', '2014-01-27 01:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7163162, 1099583, 108069, '<td valign="top">Incredible detail. This is so close and so vivid, with such perfect focus, that I can only imagine it''s been taken by this bird''s nestmate or child. Obviously this would result in a DQ, which is a shame, as it''s an excellent photo.</td>', 'Incredible detail. This is so close and so vivid, with such perfect focus, that I can only imagine it''s been taken by this bird''s nestmate or child. Obviously this would result in a DQ, which is a shame, as it''s an excellent photo.', '2014-01-27 01:14:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7163164, 1099704, 16148, '<td valign="top">Nice wall art for a backdrop and interesting person in black.  I wish you had taken this image a few steps later so your subject was just out of reach.</td>', 'Nice wall art for a backdrop and interesting person in black.  I wish you had taken this image a few steps later so your subject was just out of reach.', '2014-01-27 01:17:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7163167, 1099949, 16148, '<td valign="top">Lovely portrait!  Beautiful warm tones.</td>', 'Lovely portrait!  Beautiful warm tones.', '2014-01-27 01:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7163171, 1099979, 25355, '<td valign="top">This look like one of those Where''s Wally shots. But I can''t find him.<br/> <br/>Maybe the leading lines lead to a too central a point.</td>', 'This look like one of those Where''s Wally shots. But I can''t find him. Maybe the leading lines lead to a too central a point.', '2014-01-27 01:31:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7163173, 1098886, 25355, '<td valign="top">Getting into Ann Geddes territory here, perhaps.<br/> <br/>But, hey, babies are brought by the stalk. But that''s not a stalk, it''s  branch.<br/>(Laughs - or groans - all round).</td>', 'Getting into Ann Geddes territory here, perhaps. But, hey, babies are brought by the stalk. But that''s not a stalk, it''s  branch.(Laughs - or groans - all round).', '2014-01-27 01:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7163174, 1099873, 25355, '<td valign="top">The mysterious arc at the top bothers me somewhat, but nice tonal work.</td>', 'The mysterious arc at the top bothers me somewhat, but nice tonal work.', '2014-01-27 01:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7163175, 1099744, 108069, '<td valign="top">International Fountain, eh? Cool shot, nice moment. Really well seen. Bit tight up top, I think, but what do I know? -&gt; Nothing.</td>', 'International Fountain, eh? Cool shot, nice moment. Really well seen. Bit tight up top, I think, but what do I know? -> Nothing.', '2014-01-27 01:37:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7163176, 1099979, 16148, '<td valign="top">High contrast works well for this and that bench looks inviting.  Very nice!</td>', 'High contrast works well for this and that bench looks inviting.  Very nice!', '2014-01-27 01:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7163177, 1100003, 16148, '<td valign="top">Smoke ring for his  halo.  I like the square crop.</td>', 'Smoke ring for his  halo.  I like the square crop.', '2014-01-27 01:41:37.000000', NULL, 1),
