(7163225, 1100131, 22459, '<td valign="top">Yep I had to look up "paradigmaticism"....I like that the image to me has so many layers! I see things/subjects within each other....very nice indeed. The hand is the masterpiece to the image</td>', 'Yep I had to look up "paradigmaticism"....I like that the image to me has so many layers! I see things/subjects within each other....very nice indeed. The hand is the masterpiece to the image', '2014-01-27 04:13:52.000000', NULL, 1),
