(7163238, 1099886, 22459, '<td valign="top">Nice image and colours</td>', 'Nice image and colours', '2014-01-27 05:40:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7163244, 1099852, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, you look familiar, Hanneke?  Anyway, I am a huge fan of really high contrast images so for my personal taste it''s a bit flat, but still nice, gave a 6.</td>', 'Nice photo, you look familiar, Hanneke?  Anyway, I am a huge fan of really high contrast images so for my personal taste it''s a bit flat, but still nice, gave a 6.', '2014-01-27 06:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7163245, 1099564, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, but for my taste I feel the framing is a bit off, too little space above the bird and too much reflection, my eye actually wanders more towards the reflection than the actual bird.  Definately above average though!</td>', 'Nice photo, but for my taste I feel the framing is a bit off, too little space above the bird and too much reflection, my eye actually wanders more towards the reflection than the actual bird.  Definately above average though!', '2014-01-27 06:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7163246, 1099190, 27482, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot, would have been proud to have taken this myself.  Only thing that drags it down for me is the framing, a bit too central for my taste, but still an 8 in my books</td>', 'Very nice shot, would have been proud to have taken this myself.  Only thing that drags it down for me is the framing, a bit too central for my taste, but still an 8 in my books', '2014-01-27 06:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7163247, 1099926, 27482, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot, I like it a lot, the birds add a lot to it.</td>', 'Very nice shot, I like it a lot, the birds add a lot to it.', '2014-01-27 06:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7163248, 1099872, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I gave this a three and thought I''d at least have the decency to tell you why, that it''s just my personal taste, I have never been a fan of "blurry artsy" photos but I get the feeling a lot of people would dissagree with me :)</td>', 'Sorry, I gave this a three and thought I''d at least have the decency to tell you why, that it''s just my personal taste, I have never been a fan of "blurry artsy" photos but I get the feeling a lot of people would dissagree with me :)', '2014-01-27 06:49:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7163249, 1100070, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice black and white tones</td>', 'Nice black and white tones', '2014-01-27 06:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7163250, 1100063, 27482, '<td valign="top">Technically very well done, sharp as a razor and nice colours, but I have just seen too many of these to find it interesting as there is nothing really going on in this photo except a bug standing on vegetation, still a 6 though :)</td>', 'Technically very well done, sharp as a razor and nice colours, but I have just seen too many of these to find it interesting as there is nothing really going on in this photo except a bug standing on vegetation, still a 6 though :)', '2014-01-27 06:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7163251, 1100131, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sorry but I have never liked "blurry, artsy" photos, so this is just my personal opinion, would have given this a 1 but at least you can tell it''s a person in the photo so I clicked 2.  Thought I''d at least have the decency to tell you why.</td>', 'Sorry but I have never liked "blurry, artsy" photos, so this is just my personal opinion, would have given this a 1 but at least you can tell it''s a person in the photo so I clicked 2.  Thought I''d at least have the decency to tell you why.', '2014-01-27 06:52:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7163252, 1099444, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice photo of what looks like Gunnuhver, wish DPC would allow for bigger images than 800 pixles as this get''s lost in my monitor, not your fault, gave this a 9, highest score from me so far.</td>', 'Nice photo of what looks like Gunnuhver, wish DPC would allow for bigger images than 800 pixles as this get''s lost in my monitor, not your fault, gave this a 9, highest score from me so far.', '2014-01-27 06:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7163253, 1099192, 27482, '<td valign="top">Very cool, I really like the light in this photo and the absolute black surroundings.</td>', 'Very cool, I really like the light in this photo and the absolute black surroundings.', '2014-01-27 06:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7163254, 1099601, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sorry but in my opinion you went way overboard with the processing of this photo, way too much contrast (and coming from me, who really likes strong contrast, that''s saying a lot), I''d almost say that for me, you pretty much ruined a good sunset photo.  3</td>', 'Sorry but in my opinion you went way overboard with the processing of this photo, way too much contrast (and coming from me, who really likes strong contrast, that''s saying a lot), I''d almost say that for me, you pretty much ruined a good sunset photo.  3', '2014-01-27 06:55:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7163255, 1099128, 27482, '<td valign="top">Feel like I have seen this staircase before</td>', 'Feel like I have seen this staircase before', '2014-01-27 06:55:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7163256, 1099998, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sorry but never been a fan of "artsy, blurry" photos so this is a 2 from me, mostly because I like the sense of motion in this photo but I can''t tell what it is, thought I''d at least have the decency to explain the low vote.</td>', 'Sorry but never been a fan of "artsy, blurry" photos so this is a 2 from me, mostly because I like the sense of motion in this photo but I can''t tell what it is, thought I''d at least have the decency to explain the low vote.', '2014-01-27 06:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7163257, 1100117, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, but looking at it I feel the framing would have been better if you had turned the camera upwards and to the left, the black foreground and black bush should be there, just not so much of it and I want to see more of the city.</td>', 'Nice photo, but looking at it I feel the framing would have been better if you had turned the camera upwards and to the left, the black foreground and black bush should be there, just not so much of it and I want to see more of the city.', '2014-01-27 06:58:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7163258, 1099896, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not bad, but frankly seen hundreds of photos like this and sorry, I find them very boring by now and this one doesn''t seem as sharp as it could have been, not sure if it''s slightly out of focus or not frozen well enough because of long flash durations on your lighting equipment or insuficcient shutterspeeds if you used a continuous light.  Still a 5 though, neiter bad nor good.</td>', 'Not bad, but frankly seen hundreds of photos like this and sorry, I find them very boring by now and this one doesn''t seem as sharp as it could have been, not sure if it''s slightly out of focus or not frozen well enough because of long flash durations on your lighting equipment or insuficcient shutterspeeds if you used a continuous light.  Still a 5 though, neiter bad nor good.', '2014-01-27 06:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
