(7163263, 1099811, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not bad, but two things I don''t really care for, first, the frame I honestly find awful, but not going to knock off any points for that.  Secondly, I do like the occasional wide angle twisted perspective image, but here, I don''t really care for it, it makes her arms seem baby sized and really wierd.</td>', 'Not bad, but two things I don''t really care for, first, the frame I honestly find awful, but not going to knock off any points for that.  Secondly, I do like the occasional wide angle twisted perspective image, but here, I don''t really care for it, it makes her arms seem baby sized and really wierd.', '2014-01-27 07:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
