(7163719, 1100137, 69450, '<td valign="top">Serendipitous shot, but I feel like the processing detracts from it. The man appears to have a dark halo and the photo itself seems to be treated with an orton effect (soft glowy feel).</td>', 'Serendipitous shot, but I feel like the processing detracts from it. The man appears to have a dark halo and the photo itself seems to be treated with an orton effect (soft glowy feel).', '2014-01-27 22:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
