(7163722, 1099455, 69450, '<td valign="top">One of the few photos with a title that''s trying to be smart and actually is. Nice shot.</td>', 'One of the few photos with a title that''s trying to be smart and actually is. Nice shot.', '2014-01-27 22:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7163724, 1098879, 69450, '<td valign="top">With a title like that, I feel like a few different creative choices could have made this a wonderful photo. In particular, I think a much longer shutter speed would have been nice (granted, not everyone has a thick ND sitting around). The slightly slow shutter speed gives a feeling of movement and speed which seems to contradict the title.</td>', 'With a title like that, I feel like a few different creative choices could have made this a wonderful photo. In particular, I think a much longer shutter speed would have been nice (granted, not everyone has a thick ND sitting around). The slightly slow shutter speed gives a feeling of movement and speed which seems to contradict the title.', '2014-01-27 22:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7163726, 1100131, 86447, '<td valign="top">Ben?<br/> <br/>Or... maybe not.   Not sure.<br/> <br/>Seems like his work.<br/> <br/> <br/>(voting later)</td>', 'Ben? Or... maybe not.   Not sure. Seems like his work.  (voting later)', '2014-01-27 23:12:39.000000', NULL, 1),
