(7164323, 1099984, 96530, '<td valign="top">Looks vaguely familiar to me ;) A little more of a processed look than I typically go for, but this does make for an interesting take. You were lucky to get this much sun in Seattle- I tried! Good luck :)</td>', 'Looks vaguely familiar to me ;) A little more of a processed look than I typically go for, but this does make for an interesting take. You were lucky to get this much sun in Seattle- I tried! Good luck :)', '2014-01-28 18:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
