(7164377, 1099906, 96530, '<td valign="top">Seems a different style for you Justin and goes to show your great versatility. Makes me think of an old master''s painting somehow. Very nicely done, good luck!</td>', 'Seems a different style for you Justin and goes to show your great versatility. Makes me think of an old master''s painting somehow. Very nicely done, good luck!', '2014-01-28 19:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
