(7164385, 1099998, 96530, '<td valign="top">Very nice abstract (kids on a court maybe?). Not sure it suggests fog to me, but I like it all the same :)</td>', 'Very nice abstract (kids on a court maybe?). Not sure it suggests fog to me, but I like it all the same :)', '2014-01-28 20:00:52.000000', NULL, 1),
