(7164424, 1099253, 30982, '<td valign="top">The wee bit of firelight caught in her eye is very nice.  The balance (composition, maybe?) feels just a little bit off - perhaps too much fire in the foreground.</td>', 'The wee bit of firelight caught in her eye is very nice.  The balance (composition, maybe?) feels just a little bit off - perhaps too much fire in the foreground.', '2014-01-28 21:04:42.000000', NULL, 1),
