(7164625, 1098879, 30982, '<td valign="top">Really nice color, good exposure choice for the right amount of motion.  The triangular pattern of the wreckage is strangely static to me.</td>', 'Really nice color, good exposure choice for the right amount of motion.  The triangular pattern of the wreckage is strangely static to me.', '2014-01-29 01:08:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7164627, 1099872, 30982, '<td valign="top">Only the shadow knows the secret of the hanging chair.  The guy in gold needs to be warned.  A fascinating photograph - thanks!</td>', 'Only the shadow knows the secret of the hanging chair.  The guy in gold needs to be warned.  A fascinating photograph - thanks!', '2014-01-29 01:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7164628, 1099670, 30982, '<td valign="top">Rich market for photographs - showing us scenes I''ll wager most of us don''t get a chance to view in person.  Nice work with the exposure and I like the whole scene included with all the various stories.</td>', 'Rich market for photographs - showing us scenes I''ll wager most of us don''t get a chance to view in person.  Nice work with the exposure and I like the whole scene included with all the various stories.', '2014-01-29 01:11:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7164629, 1099906, 30982, '<td valign="top">Masters style lighting - it''s almost a monochromatic painting.</td>', 'Masters style lighting - it''s almost a monochromatic painting.', '2014-01-29 01:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7164631, 1100149, 30982, '<td valign="top">Feels very crisp and cold!  A bit too almost but not quite centered with respect to the sun.</td>', 'Feels very crisp and cold!  A bit too almost but not quite centered with respect to the sun.', '2014-01-29 01:13:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7164632, 1100115, 30982, '<td valign="top">Dang, that''s HUGE.  Nicely photographed!</td>', 'Dang, that''s HUGE.  Nicely photographed!', '2014-01-29 01:14:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7164634, 1099170, 161446, '<td valign="top"><strike></strike></td>', '', '2014-01-29 01:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7164636, 1099128, 30982, '<td valign="top">A pleasing geometric with good light and shadow.</td>', 'A pleasing geometric with good light and shadow.', '2014-01-29 01:18:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7164638, 1099926, 30982, '<td valign="top">Quite like the bird!  And the red bit in all that sea of blue.</td>', 'Quite like the bird!  And the red bit in all that sea of blue.', '2014-01-29 01:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7164639, 1099915, 40391, '<td valign="top">Worthy of a national ballet promotional poster.</td>', 'Worthy of a national ballet promotional poster.', '2014-01-29 01:19:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7164640, 1100136, 30982, '<td valign="top">Oh my gosh, that''s just entirely too cute.  Cheating, you realize, entering a picture of an adorable critter posing every so nicely for you.  But cute!</td>', 'Oh my gosh, that''s just entirely too cute.  Cheating, you realize, entering a picture of an adorable critter posing every so nicely for you.  But cute!', '2014-01-29 01:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7164641, 1100099, 30982, '<td valign="top">Oh my gosh, they ARE!  How adorable!  Love the golden light, too.</td>', 'Oh my gosh, they ARE!  How adorable!  Love the golden light, too.', '2014-01-29 01:20:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7164643, 1099650, 40391, '<td valign="top">Lovely details.</td>', 'Lovely details.', '2014-01-29 01:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7164644, 1099702, 30982, '<td valign="top">She almost looks as though she''s floating when you first see it, as though she''s been pasted into the background - probably a result of how dark/sharp her cape is against the OOF background.  Love the wee bits of foliage to the left, and would guess she looks less pasted in if seen in a larger size.</td>', 'She almost looks as though she''s floating when you first see it, as though she''s been pasted into the background - probably a result of how dark/sharp her cape is against the OOF background.  Love the wee bits of foliage to the left, and would guess she looks less pasted in if seen in a larger size.', '2014-01-29 01:21:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7164645, 1099733, 30982, '<td valign="top">Penetrating eyes!  Can''t say I''m fond of the finger in her mouth, though.</td>', 'Penetrating eyes!  Can''t say I''m fond of the finger in her mouth, though.', '2014-01-29 01:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7164649, 1100131, 40391, '<td valign="top">Very emotional.</td>', 'Very emotional.', '2014-01-29 01:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7164650, 1099252, 30982, '<td valign="top">Crystalline air at those altitudes!  A wee bit flat (not sure that''s what I''m looking for) in the foreground - might be just a bit too dark to see the detail on my monitor.</td>', 'Crystalline air at those altitudes!  A wee bit flat (not sure that''s what I''m looking for) in the foreground - might be just a bit too dark to see the detail on my monitor.', '2014-01-29 01:23:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7164651, 1099650, 30982, '<td valign="top">Lovely detail and a gorgeous bird!</td>', 'Lovely detail and a gorgeous bird!', '2014-01-29 01:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7164652, 1099293, 40391, '<td valign="top">Lovely details.</td>', 'Lovely details.', '2014-01-29 01:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7164653, 1100117, 30982, '<td valign="top">Interesting title, as there''s a bit of distance between them.  Lovely view!</td>', 'Interesting title, as there''s a bit of distance between them.  Lovely view!', '2014-01-29 01:24:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7164654, 1099996, 40391, '<td valign="top">It''s hard to beat the combination of sun and rain. Nicely done.</td>', 'It''s hard to beat the combination of sun and rain. Nicely done.', '2014-01-29 01:24:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7164655, 1099164, 30982, '<td valign="top">I suspect he''s racing a different course than the one the gate pictured is on, or he''s pretty far off course!  Nice catch of the snowflakes!</td>', 'I suspect he''s racing a different course than the one the gate pictured is on, or he''s pretty far off course!  Nice catch of the snowflakes!', '2014-01-29 01:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7164656, 1099733, 40391, '<td valign="top">Beautiful innocents.</td>', 'Beautiful innocents.', '2014-01-29 01:25:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7164658, 1099896, 30982, '<td valign="top">A few hot highlights here and there but an interesting shape captured!</td>', 'A few hot highlights here and there but an interesting shape captured!', '2014-01-29 01:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7164659, 1100009, 30982, '<td valign="top">An elaborate title for a portrait so simple and real.  The soft light and lack of excessive editing is refreshing.</td>', 'An elaborate title for a portrait so simple and real.  The soft light and lack of excessive editing is refreshing.', '2014-01-29 01:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7164660, 1100009, 40391, '<td valign="top">I really like this composition.</td>', 'I really like this composition.', '2014-01-29 01:27:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7164661, 1100097, 30982, '<td valign="top">Goodness - what were these things for?  If a pier, it was a rather huge pier!</td>', 'Goodness - what were these things for?  If a pier, it was a rather huge pier!', '2014-01-29 01:27:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7164662, 1099583, 30982, '<td valign="top">Wonderful detail, especially the criss-cross pattern in the feathers.</td>', 'Wonderful detail, especially the criss-cross pattern in the feathers.', '2014-01-29 01:28:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7164663, 1098780, 30982, '<td valign="top">Oh, how can you not love that face.  Light, depth, toning - all wonderful.</td>', 'Oh, how can you not love that face.  Light, depth, toning - all wonderful.', '2014-01-29 01:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7164664, 1099744, 30982, '<td valign="top">Oh how delightful!!!  Excellent title as well.</td>', 'Oh how delightful!!!  Excellent title as well.', '2014-01-29 01:29:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7164665, 1100124, 30982, '<td valign="top">What happens when the osprey comes back??  Beautifully photographed - excellent detail and warmth of color.</td>', 'What happens when the osprey comes back??  Beautifully photographed - excellent detail and warmth of color.', '2014-01-29 01:29:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7164666, 1100137, 40391, '<td valign="top">I''m sure if this was in an art gallery there would be many who would stop and enjoy. A truly masterful image.</td>', 'I''m sure if this was in an art gallery there would be many who would stop and enjoy. A truly masterful image.', '2014-01-29 01:29:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7164667, 1099601, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very boldly edited!  A bit over the top for my taste, but it does present a strong visual.</td>', 'Very boldly edited!  A bit over the top for my taste, but it does present a strong visual.', '2014-01-29 01:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7164668, 1100114, 30982, '<td valign="top">So pristine, perfect and empty.  It begs the question of who the sanctuary is for?  Of course photographing something like this with no people in it is easier and preferred by most for the clarity.  It is a gorgeous, gorgeous building.</td>', 'So pristine, perfect and empty.  It begs the question of who the sanctuary is for?  Of course photographing something like this with no people in it is easier and preferred by most for the clarity.  It is a gorgeous, gorgeous building.', '2014-01-29 01:31:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7164669, 1099564, 40391, '<td valign="top">A touched cramped but a really amazing wildlife capture.</td>', 'A touched cramped but a really amazing wildlife capture.', '2014-01-29 01:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7164670, 1099937, 30982, '<td valign="top">Is that a turtle?  I''m guessing the other dead thing is a large bird of some kind, but a turtle?  I like how the ducks beyond are completely unruffled by it all.</td>', 'Is that a turtle?  I''m guessing the other dead thing is a large bird of some kind, but a turtle?  I like how the ducks beyond are completely unruffled by it all.', '2014-01-29 01:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7164672, 1099565, 30982, '<td valign="top">The motion and lack of clarifying light is enough to evoke the dream sense your title implies.  The ride stuff in the upper right is somewhat offputting, but in a way that works within the photograph, if that makes sense.</td>', 'The motion and lack of clarifying light is enough to evoke the dream sense your title implies.  The ride stuff in the upper right is somewhat offputting, but in a way that works within the photograph, if that makes sense.', '2014-01-29 01:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7164673, 1100003, 40391, '<td valign="top">Marvellous perspective and so many stories imaginable.</td>', 'Marvellous perspective and so many stories imaginable.', '2014-01-29 01:33:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7164674, 1100151, 40391, '<td valign="top">The perfect title.</td>', 'The perfect title.', '2014-01-29 01:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7164675, 1100095, 40391, '<td valign="top">I hope someone had your back?</td>', 'I hope someone had your back?', '2014-01-29 01:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7164676, 1099170, 30982, '<td valign="top">A nice pastoral view - love the old shed beyond with the rusted roof.  I likwe the grays of the trees, but am not overly thrilled with the way the editing affected your sky.</td>', 'A nice pastoral view - love the old shed beyond with the rusted roof.  I likwe the grays of the trees, but am not overly thrilled with the way the editing affected your sky.', '2014-01-29 01:35:10.000000', NULL, 1),
