(7164679, 1099619, 30982, '<td valign="top">A performance or competition with which I am not familiar, but I very much like this view of it you''ve chosen to show us.</td>', 'A performance or competition with which I am not familiar, but I very much like this view of it you''ve chosen to show us.', '2014-01-29 01:35:57.000000', NULL, 1),
