(7164681, 1099471, 30982, '<td valign="top">I can smell the cinnamon on the apples!  I''m guessing the specks are vanilla?  I only wish we could taste what you so carefully create and photograph!</td>', 'I can smell the cinnamon on the apples!  I''m guessing the specks are vanilla?  I only wish we could taste what you so carefully create and photograph!', '2014-01-29 01:36:54.000000', NULL, 1),
