(7165573, 1099702, 173844, '<td valign="top">Very interesting image in which indistinct landscape is used to set off a shallow depth of field foreground.  The central character, who looks like she''s floating, is subtly framed by patches of vegetation.  I like it, though the atmosphere seems more pensive than ominous.</td>', 'Very interesting image in which indistinct landscape is used to set off a shallow depth of field foreground.  The central character, who looks like she''s floating, is subtly framed by patches of vegetation.  I like it, though the atmosphere seems more pensive than ominous.', '2014-01-30 11:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7165576, 1099904, 173844, '<td valign="top">Almost overwhelmingly busy cypress swamp (?) both seems to draw one in and forbid entry.  Use of black and white invites the viewer to see this image as a pattern of lines and textures.  Intriguing.</td>', 'Almost overwhelmingly busy cypress swamp (?) both seems to draw one in and forbid entry.  Use of black and white invites the viewer to see this image as a pattern of lines and textures.  Intriguing.', '2014-01-30 12:05:12.000000', NULL, 1),
