(7165617, 1100093, 173844, '<td valign="top">Wonderful portrait with, as stated in the title, light and shadow --- most ably deployed.  The details emerging from the shadows testify to the success of this effort.  Sealed with a kiss.</td>', 'Wonderful portrait with, as stated in the title, light and shadow --- most ably deployed.  The details emerging from the shadows testify to the success of this effort.  Sealed with a kiss.', '2014-01-30 14:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7165621, 1099598, 173844, '<td valign="top">Because I have no special knowledge of wooden canoes I''m sure I''m not giving this handsome craft its due.  It''s the fairy tale-like surrounds that appeals to me. The light on the moss-covered trees and rock, and on the stone structure, is what I really like.</td>', 'Because I have no special knowledge of wooden canoes I''m sure I''m not giving this handsome craft its due.  It''s the fairy tale-like surrounds that appeals to me. The light on the moss-covered trees and rock, and on the stone structure, is what I really like.', '2014-01-30 15:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7165622, 1100131, 30214, '<td valign="top">bad dream... but good image</td>', 'bad dream... but good image', '2014-01-30 15:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7165627, 1100097, 173844, '<td valign="top">There''s a clear, clean serenity to this image that is very satisfying to gaze upon.  Is the title implying that these wooden pilings are reminiscent of a cemetery?  I like that somersault of imagery.  The black borders do not add to the photo, in my opinion.</td>', 'There''s a clear, clean serenity to this image that is very satisfying to gaze upon.  Is the title implying that these wooden pilings are reminiscent of a cemetery?  I like that somersault of imagery.  The black borders do not add to the photo, in my opinion.', '2014-01-30 15:14:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7165634, 1100024, 173844, '<td valign="top">Great black and white photo.  The depth of focus, highlighting that rib cage, is a perfect choice.  The light bulbs are a marvel.  The people here are secondary, which suits the main focus of attention.</td>', 'Great black and white photo.  The depth of focus, highlighting that rib cage, is a perfect choice.  The light bulbs are a marvel.  The people here are secondary, which suits the main focus of attention.', '2014-01-30 15:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
