(7165639, 1099565, 173844, '<td valign="top">Very interesting presentation of a nude woman.  Glories in its idiosyncrasy.  Has a mythic feel.  It all works together quite well.</td>', 'Very interesting presentation of a nude woman.  Glories in its idiosyncrasy.  Has a mythic feel.  It all works together quite well.', '2014-01-30 15:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7165642, 1099811, 173844, '<td valign="top">Winning portrait, curious choice of clothing and perspective.  While I like the portrait -- she''s pretty and vivacious -- I can''t just put it all together as a whole.  Still graded it high, just because...</td>', 'Winning portrait, curious choice of clothing and perspective.  While I like the portrait -- she''s pretty and vivacious -- I can''t just put it all together as a whole.  Still graded it high, just because...', '2014-01-30 15:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
