(7165775, 1099811, 40718, '<td valign="top">Very interesting, but the angle leads me to not know if she is standing or sitting so my mind wrestles with this rather than enjoying the photo.  Still, the lighting on her face, eyes, lips, and hair is wonderful. (not voting)</td>', 'Very interesting, but the angle leads me to not know if she is standing or sitting so my mind wrestles with this rather than enjoying the photo.  Still, the lighting on her face, eyes, lips, and hair is wonderful. (not voting)', '2014-01-30 19:36:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7165779, 1099996, 40718, '<td valign="top">Ah.  I don''t think they have created a camera yet that can capture what your eye saw which made you want to take this picture.  I know.  I''ve tried and tried to capture the luminescent green of backlit leaves along with voluminous light captured by fog or, in this case, water (realizing this is hosewater and not rain). (not voting)</td>', 'Ah.  I don''t think they have created a camera yet that can capture what your eye saw which made you want to take this picture.  I know.  I''ve tried and tried to capture the luminescent green of backlit leaves along with voluminous light captured by fog or, in this case, water (realizing this is hosewater and not rain). (not voting)', '2014-01-30 19:38:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7165783, 1100004, 40718, '<td valign="top">chuckle.  I''m curious if you set the stage with things like the bike and ball.  If not, they serendipitously work to balance both the color and weight of the image. (not voting)</td>', 'chuckle.  I''m curious if you set the stage with things like the bike and ball.  If not, they serendipitously work to balance both the color and weight of the image. (not voting)', '2014-01-30 19:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
