(7165787, 1099650, 40718, '<td valign="top">Snowy owls are just awesome to me.  Frankly I''d love to see ANY owl in the wild, but seeing a snowy would be the bee''s knees. (not voting)</td>', 'Snowy owls are just awesome to me.  Frankly I''d love to see ANY owl in the wild, but seeing a snowy would be the bee''s knees. (not voting)', '2014-01-30 19:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
