(7166001, 1100082, 45524, '<td valign="top">I really like the coloring and framing of this image except I really wish you hadn''t cut the mast off on the front boat at the right. Good luck.</td>', 'I really like the coloring and framing of this image except I really wish you hadn''t cut the mast off on the front boat at the right. Good luck.', '2014-01-31 00:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7166248, 1099564, 173844, '<td valign="top">Wonderful, wonderful image.  I don''t think bird photography offers anything better.  The pose is elegant and sculptural, graceful and energetic.  Not only is the shadow cast on its own wing terrific, the real fish is held close to where the eye of the shadow would appear.  Also enhancing the photo are the ripples, droplets and reflection. The wood on the right -- and hey, things are where they are -- is the only distraction.</td>', 'Wonderful, wonderful image.  I don''t think bird photography offers anything better.  The pose is elegant and sculptural, graceful and energetic.  Not only is the shadow cast on its own wing terrific, the real fish is held close to where the eye of the shadow would appear.  Also enhancing the photo are the ripples, droplets and reflection. The wood on the right -- and hey, things are where they are -- is the only distraction.', '2014-01-31 10:56:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7166249, 1099126, 173844, '<td valign="top">Artful, appealing image of a lovely girl behind glass.  The paint-like effect works very well.  The blue hat provides a nice splash of color.  It''s her joyful expression that really makes the picture sing.</td>', 'Artful, appealing image of a lovely girl behind glass.  The paint-like effect works very well.  The blue hat provides a nice splash of color.  It''s her joyful expression that really makes the picture sing.', '2014-01-31 10:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7166250, 1100070, 173844, '<td valign="top">I really like this stark image with the in-your-face dried roadbed. It''s vast and intimate at the same time.  Honest and unflinching.</td>', 'I really like this stark image with the in-your-face dried roadbed. It''s vast and intimate at the same time.  Honest and unflinching.', '2014-01-31 10:56:43.000000', NULL, 1),
