(7166888, 1099170, 173844, '<td valign="top">Serene pastoral scene.  I like how the image flows from gently rolling terrain to a swath of woods to encircling mountains to a big sky.  I love the color of the structure''s roof.</td>', 'Serene pastoral scene.  I like how the image flows from gently rolling terrain to a swath of woods to encircling mountains to a big sky.  I love the color of the structure''s roof.', '2014-02-01 10:54:08.000000', NULL, 1),
