(7166896, 1100109, 173844, '<td valign="top">When these beautifully colored, propeller-shaped flowers are so reflected we are now drawn into a confusing and tickling abstract of shapes and rhythms.  Holds my attention.</td>', 'When these beautifully colored, propeller-shaped flowers are so reflected we are now drawn into a confusing and tickling abstract of shapes and rhythms.  Holds my attention.', '2014-02-01 11:04:31.000000', NULL, 1),
