(7167541, 1099677, 29011, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Really like the dynamic range and color. Only suggestion would be to perhaps crop just a little off the top? Getting rid of that sliver of a darker line. Maybe if it was more evenly distributed along the edge it wouldn''t have been as out of place.</td>', 'Great shot. Really like the dynamic range and color. Only suggestion would be to perhaps crop just a little off the top? Getting rid of that sliver of a darker line. Maybe if it was more evenly distributed along the edge it wouldn''t have been as out of place.', '2014-02-01 22:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
