(7167639, 1099192, 30364, '<td valign="top">Lovely.  Everything is perfectly judged, including all the things that you didn''t do.  Thank you.</td>', 'Lovely.  Everything is perfectly judged, including all the things that you didn''t do.  Thank you.', '2014-02-02 02:12:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7167641, 1099680, 30364, '<td valign="top">A very lovely leopard.  It''s so strange but true that such a stunningly beautiful animal (in colour and real life) can look even more beautiful in B&amp;W.  The photograph has to be perfect though, for it to work.  This one is, and does.   In my top three.  Thank you.</td>', 'A very lovely leopard.  It''s so strange but true that such a stunningly beautiful animal (in colour and real life) can look even more beautiful in B&W.  The photograph has to be perfect though, for it to work.  This one is, and does.   In my top three.  Thank you.', '2014-02-02 02:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7167643, 1099924, 141826, '<td valign="top">Great details...</td>', 'Great details...', '2014-02-02 02:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7167644, 1100003, 30364, '<td valign="top">Very good.  It''s an interesting picture: POV, composition &amp; crop, cast of characters.  It doesn''t feel like something I have ever seen before (and that''s a rare thing). And the picture continues, irresistibly, outside the frame.  Top three.  Thank you.</td>', 'Very good.  It''s an interesting picture: POV, composition & crop, cast of characters.  It doesn''t feel like something I have ever seen before (and that''s a rare thing). And the picture continues, irresistibly, outside the frame.  Top three.  Thank you.', '2014-02-02 02:24:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7167646, 1099774, 30364, '<td valign="top">Simply the best.  Cannot look at this without starting to sketch in details not seen in this moment.  You know the "picture is worth a thousand words" saying?  It''s almost never true; most pictures are barely worth a sentence.  But this one is worth a hundred thousand words: I imagine it as the cover of a novel, and I want to read it.  Or write it.  Thank you.</td>', 'Simply the best.  Cannot look at this without starting to sketch in details not seen in this moment.  You know the "picture is worth a thousand words" saying?  It''s almost never true; most pictures are barely worth a sentence.  But this one is worth a hundred thousand words: I imagine it as the cover of a novel, and I want to read it.  Or write it.  Thank you.', '2014-02-02 02:31:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7167647, 1099984, 25355, '<td valign="top">After a sleepless night?</td>', 'After a sleepless night?', '2014-02-02 02:33:12.000000', NULL, 1),
