(7168454, 1099190, 7467, '<td valign="top">Thanks to all for the ribbon and kind comments. When I first arrived in Fulton for the photo shoot, it started snowing... and snowing... and snowing... Initially I thought that the 300 mile drive was wasted time, but as I started shooting the contrast between these might birds and the white snow flakes gave me hope that I may get a few decent shots.<br/>Thanks again!!!</td>', 'Thanks to all for the ribbon and kind comments. When I first arrived in Fulton for the photo shoot, it started snowing... and snowing... and snowing... Initially I thought that the 300 mile drive was wasted time, but as I started shooting the contrast between these might birds and the white snow flakes gave me hope that I may get a few decent shots.Thanks again!!!', '2014-02-03 01:12:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(7168455, 1099949, 96751, '<td valign="top">As someone who really doesn''t like baby pictures very much, this stole my heart. Just lovely, Jenn. Congrats on the tt. And I wasn''t kidding about the headband....</td>', 'As someone who really doesn''t like baby pictures very much, this stole my heart. Just lovely, Jenn. Congrats on the tt. And I wasn''t kidding about the headband....', '2014-02-03 01:13:26.000000', NULL, 0),
