(7168530, 1099915, 109387, '<td valign="top">I''m so glad it is yours - no doubt this is the best photo of the challenge - it deserved much more. Here there''s emotion, technique and it can tell a story, so it''s very hard to believe that 9 voters gave you a 5- vote.</td>', 'I''m so glad it is yours - no doubt this is the best photo of the challenge - it deserved much more. Here there''s emotion, technique and it can tell a story, so it''s very hard to believe that 9 voters gave you a 5- vote.', '2014-02-03 06:31:45.000000', NULL, 0),
