(7168845, 1099598, 5354, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the kind comments and the votes.  This was the first ''serious'' photo I''ve taken in over 3 years so the invitation to enter and the kind offer from Langdon spurred me to go out with the camera again.<br/> <br/>The image was taken just before dawn on a lake high in the Welsh mountains of Snowdonia. For those fellow paddlers the boat was built in my garage over the winter/spring of 2012/13 from western red cedar and this was only its second trip.<br/> <br/>Whilst at this location I put the Gopro on a mechanical kitchen timer and took a timelapse pan.  <a href="//www.youtube.com/watch?v=m6sA18AZKJg" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//www.youtube.com/watch?v=m6sA18AZKJg</a> <br/> <br/>This was taken over 18 minutes and is comprised of 550 individual images.<br/> <br/>Enjoy</td>', 'Thanks for all the kind comments and the votes.  This was the first ''serious'' photo I''ve taken in over 3 years so the invitation to enter and the kind offer from Langdon spurred me to go out with the camera again. The image was taken just before dawn on a lake high in the Welsh mountains of Snowdonia. For those fellow paddlers the boat was built in my garage over the winter/spring of 2012/13 from western red cedar and this was only its second trip. Whilst at this location I put the Gopro on a mechanical kitchen timer and took a timelapse pan.  //www.youtube.com/watch?v=m6sA18AZKJg  This was taken over 18 minutes and is comprised of 550 individual images. Enjoy', '2014-02-03 15:29:40.000000', NULL, 0),
