(7170209, 1099455, 53572, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=657243" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_657243.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_657243.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_657243.jpg"/></a> The x prize is back, ''cause I''m back. These are for the lowest placers of my highest scores: those who wuz robbed...<br/> <br/>I''m amazed this didn''t do better.  A lovely star shot; nicely done indeed!</td>', ' The x prize is back, ''cause I''m back. These are for the lowest placers of my highest scores: those who wuz robbed... I''m amazed this didn''t do better.  A lovely star shot; nicely done indeed!', '2014-02-05 15:36:47.000000', NULL, 0),
