(7170630, 1099583, 30982, '<td valign="top">There you go, stirring up the whole of the DPC pot and such.  Silly girl.... and with a bird.  Why couldn''t it be a squirrel?  Have you abandoned the poor squirrels?  Who will care for them?  Feed them peanuts?  Oh wait!  You''re giving the peanuts to the birds now!  The poor squirrels....  At the very least, shoot a pigeon next, will ya?  :-)</td>', 'There you go, stirring up the whole of the DPC pot and such.  Silly girl.... and with a bird.  Why couldn''t it be a squirrel?  Have you abandoned the poor squirrels?  Who will care for them?  Feed them peanuts?  Oh wait!  You''re giving the peanuts to the birds now!  The poor squirrels....  At the very least, shoot a pigeon next, will ya?  :-)', '2014-02-06 01:31:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(7170939, 1099770, 9581, '<td valign="top">This is really nice to look at. I liked it and thought it would of done better. Maybe the crop or size made others think different... like longer at the top and shorter on sides.. :)</td>', 'This is really nice to look at. I liked it and thought it would of done better. Maybe the crop or size made others think different... like longer at the top and shorter on sides.. :)', '2014-02-06 14:47:02.000000', NULL, 0),
